OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric England objects to
OL,4,Amissile motor factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a missile motor factory could
OL,7,Fbe shot down by objections over its
OL,8,Fimpact on a former RAF base in Norfolk.
OL,10,FCambridge Aerospace, which has a
OL,11,Fcontract with the Ministry of Defence
OL,12,F(MoD) to build anti-drone missiles, has
OL,13,Fsaid it wants to invest about #24m to
OL,14,Fexpand its operations at Scottow, the
OL,15,Fsite of the former RAF Coltishall base.
OL,17,FBut Historic England has warned the
OL,18,Fplans would cause "severe harm" to what
OL,19,Fit describes as one of the UK's "most
OL,20,Fcomplete surviving examples of Cold War
OL,21,Fmilitary infrastructure".
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
