OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric England objects to
OL,4,Amissile motor factory
OL,5,
OL,6,FCambridge Aerospace said the site had
OL,7,Fbeen "a key base for UK defence" since
OL,8,FWorld War Two, and it wanted to build
OL,9,Fon that legacy.
